  5000.0 ? relay1=nc relay2=nc relay3=nc relay4=nc relay5=nc relay6=no dial=c9 outLamp1=off outLamp2=off outLamp3=off outLamp4=off outLamp5=off outLamp6=off indLamp1=off indLamp2=off indLamp3=off indLamp4=off indLamp5=off indLamp6=off  "This game is played with two persons; MINIVAC acts as the game board and referee. The object of the game is to make the rotary switch dial stop at the WIN position for the player. If the dial stops at 9, player 1 wins; if the dial stops at 7, player 2 wins. Player 1 uses pushbutton 1; player 2 uses pushbutton 6. The rotary switch knob turns: counterclockwise (towards 9) if pushbuttons 1 and 6 are in the same position (both up or both down.) clockwise (towards 7) if pushbuttons 1 and 6 are in different positions."
